<Window xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        x:Class="MoTuPerf.Desktop.ChangelogWindow"
        Title="更新日志"
        Width="700"
        SizeToContent="Height"
        MaxHeight="640"
        MinWidth="620"
        CanResize="False"
        WindowDecorations="BorderOnly"
        ExtendClientAreaToDecorationsHint="True"
        ExtendClientAreaTitleBarHeightHint="0"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner">
  <Border Classes="secondaryWindowFrame">
    <Grid RowDefinitions="48,*,58">
      <Border Grid.Row="0" Classes="dialogTitleBar" PointerPressed="DialogTitlePointerPressed">
        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,46">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="24,0,0,0">
            <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconHistory}" Foreground="{DynamicResource Theme.Accent}" Width="18" Height="18" Margin="0,0,10,0" />
            <TextBlock Text="更新日志" Classes="sectionTitle" />
          </StackPanel>
          <Button Grid.Column="1" Classes="windowButton closeButton" Content="&#x00D7;" Click="CloseWindow" ToolTip.Tip="关闭" />
        </Grid>
      </Border>
      <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
          <StackPanel Margin="22,10,18,12" Spacing="9">
          <Border Classes="helpSection">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="v0.54.0" Classes="helpTitle" />
              <TextBlock Text="2026-10-22" Classes="dialogHint" />
              <TextBlock Classes="helpBody" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="• 曲线分析的每个指标选择栏新增“相同时间趋势”开关，默认关闭；勾选后所有现场曲线按各自完整采集时长等比拉伸到最长现场，取消勾选恢复原始时间轴。&#10;• 该功能只改变图表查看方式，不修改原始采样、统计结果、现场文件或导出数据；同一开关状态会同步应用到帧率、帧耗时、处理器、内存、温度与系统热状态分类。&#10;• 重新设计顶部“曲线分析 / 返回性能监控”入口，改为独立描边导航按钮并使用方向箭头，与“数据显示”页面标题形成明确的动作和内容层级区分。" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border Classes="helpSection">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="v0.53.2" Classes="helpTitle" />
              <TextBlock Text="2026-10-22" Classes="dialogHint" />
              <TextBlock Classes="helpBody" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="• 曲线分析空现场槽中的“添加现场”按钮和文件选择说明改为整体垂直居中，充分利用卡片可用高度。" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border Classes="helpSection">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="v0.53.1" Classes="helpTitle" />
              <TextBlock Text="2026-10-22" Classes="dialogHint" />
              <TextBlock Classes="helpBody" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="• 曲线分析统计表的现场列改为单行优先使用完整列宽，长文件名只在列末显示省略号；悬浮提示继续保留完整文件名、应用和设备信息。" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
      <Border Grid.Row="2" Classes="dialogFooter">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Spacing="8">
          <Button Classes="helpLinkButton" Content="查看完整在线更新日志" Click="OpenVersionLog" ToolTip.Tip="打开完整在线更新日志" />
          <Button Classes="primaryToolbarButton" Content="知道了" Click="CloseWindow" Width="104" Margin="0,0,18,0" />
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
    </Grid>
  </Border>
</Window>
